            .ns-Nav .t-TreeNav[aria-hidden="true"] .a-TreeView-badge { visibility: hidden; }
            @media (max-width: 479px) {
            .ns-Nav.js-navCollapsed .ns-Search, .ns-Nav.js-navCollapsed .ns-Results { display: none; }
            .ns-Design--floating.js-navCollapsed .t-Body-nav, .ns-Design--glass.js-navCollapsed .t-Body-nav { margin: 0; box-shadow: none; background: transparent; backdrop-filter: none; }
            }
            @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            .ns-Nav .t-Body-nav, .ns-Nav .t-Body-nav *, .ns-Nav .t-Header, .ns-TabBar, .ns-Tip { transition: none !important; animation: none !important; }
            }
            @media (forced-colors: active) {
            .ns-Nav .t-TreeNav .a-TreeView-row.is-selected { outline: 2px solid Highlight !important; outline-offset: -2px; }
            .ns-Nav .t-TreeNav .a-TreeView-row.is-focused { outline: 2px dashed CanvasText !important; }
            .ns-Nav .t-TreeNav .a-TreeView-badge { border: 1px solid CanvasText; }
            .ns-Nav .t-Body-nav { border-inline-end: 1px solid CanvasText; }
            .ns-Nav.js-navCollapsed:not(.ns-Design--rail) .t-TreeNav .a-TreeView-label { forced-color-adjust: none; color: transparent !important; }
            }
            ```
    }
    attributeDescriptions {
        a01: ID Attribute
        a02: Disabled (True/False)
        a03: Section Heading
        a04: Title Attribute (Used By Actions Only)
        a05: Shortcut Key
        a06: Link Target
        a10: OpenTelemetry Label
    }
    comments {
        comments: Modern Side Navigation (Navigation Studio) - a copy of Universal Theme's Side Navigation Menu with designs as template options: Design, Accent Color, Color Scheme, Header, Density, Badges, Width. Same markup and ids (t_TreeNav), so theme42.js and the keyboard work as in Universal Theme. List entry attribute 3 = a section heading above the entry; "Label [5]" shows a badge. Options: menu search (Ctrl+K), tooltips on the collapsed rail, a phone bottom bar. Optional text messages: MODERN_NAV.SEARCH, MODERN_NAV.NO_MATCH, MODERN_NAV.MENU, MODERN_NAV.QUICK_LINKS.
    }

